   ClickHouse's HTTP interface is unauthenticated by default (the `default`
   user ships with no password), and this guest's firewall scope is broad —
   reachable from every internal VLAN, matching the pattern used by the other
   datastore guests. The `default` user is therefore removed entirely via the
   `remove="1"` config-merge attribute, rather than left password-protected or
